# Sample CODEOWNERS for the training project (GitLab Premium or Ultimate).
# Copy to .gitlab/CODEOWNERS and replace the @training/... groups with groups that exist in YOUR project.
#
# Rules of this file:
#  - GitLab uses the FIRST of ./CODEOWNERS, ./docs/CODEOWNERS, ./.gitlab/CODEOWNERS that exists.
#  - Inline comments are NOT supported: keep every comment on its own line, never after an owner.
#  - Per section, the LAST matching entry wins. A file that matches in several sections needs approval from each.
#  - A file that no entry matches needs NO code owner approval, so keep a "*" default.
#  - Owners must be direct members (of the project, its group or a parent group) with at least the Developer role.

# Default section: every file needs a review from the whole team.
* @training/developers

